0.01  2026-11-15
    - Initial release: asynchronous MySQL client for EV using libmysqlclient
      (via Alien::MySQL)
    - Non-blocking connection setup, queries, result streaming, and connection
      reset via libmysqlclient *_nonblocking C API
    - Query queuing/pipelining, async transaction helpers (commit, rollback,
      autocommit), ping, select_db, set_charset, change_user, close_async
    - Prepared statements (prepare, execute, bind_params, send_long_data,
      stmt_reset, close_stmt) and multi-result draining
    - Connection options (timeouts, compression, charset, utf8, found_rows,
      multi_statements, SSL / ssl_mode / ssl_verify_server_cert)
    - Fork safety, ithread CLONE_SKIP, deferred-free callback safety
    - Short method aliases (q, prep, reconnect, disconnect, errstr, errno)
